I have noticed a little bit of an inconsistency about magic traps in Nethack
3.0 PL 5 with stop gap.  If you levitate over a magic trap you will set it
off.  This indicates to me that it is detonated by proximity as opposed to
physical contact.  If this is the case, why doesn't a magic trap go off if
you move into the square next to it?

IMHO either the trap should go off if you go near it (i.e. levitate above
it or step into the square next to it) or the trap should go off only when
it is physically stepped on.

In any case, I am really enjoying the game these days!  Keep up the good
work all of you folks on the development team.  And thanks.
